      "rationale": "קרא לרעב 'issawel lexlaḥ' — ibrahil yessaram-as lexlaḥ ad yawi amkan, mačči ara yesselmed win ara t-isewlen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "וגורי \/ תגורי",
      "rationale": "asget n uẓar gwr yettwaxelleḍ deg sin n yimukan — 'ẓeddeg anda ara tẓeddegeḍ', taɣara-nni ur teddi ara akken ilaq deg tsuqilt"
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨nekni⟩ d axxam-ik",
      "rationale": "Taɛbranit tenna kan 'kečč d axxam-ik', walant talɣiwin n tuccḍa n tmeṭṭut tameṭṭut"
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "tmeṭṭut n Cunam",
      "rationale": "Elisa yerrez awal i tmeṭṭut-nni s tedyanit, ihi d tmeṭṭut i d-yettwamlen"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Elisa yemmaẓal i tmeṭṭut-nni i iḥyan ⟨את⟩ mmi-s, ad yini: Tbedded, ṭṭef-ed abrid kečč ⟨nekni⟩ d axxam-ik, ẓeddeg anda ara tẓeddegeḍ, axaṭer Yahwe issawel lexlaḥ, ihi ad d-yaweḍ ɣef ⟨tmurt sebɛa n yiseggasen⟩.",
